        "text": "<p><span class=\"futura-bold\"><span class=\"fontsize-2-5em\"><span style=\"color: #ffb500;\"><br>\n </span></span><span style=\"color: #ffb500;\"><span class=\"fontsize-2em\"><span class=\"fontsize-1-5em\">Neuroform EZ</span></span></span><br>\n <br>\n <span class=\"fontsize-1-75em\">Stent System</span></span></p>\n<p>_____________________________________</p>\n<p><span class=\"urw-egyptienne\"><span class=\"fontsize-1-5em\">Flexible design. Enhanced delivery.</span></span></p>\n<p>The Neuroform EZ Stent System is comprised of a self-expanding Nitinol stent, pre-loaded on an enhanced Stent Delivery Wire. The Neuroform Stent is engineered for conformability, flexibility, and accessibility.<br>\n</p>\n",
